<title>MALAYSIA: Telekom shares to be requoted Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Telekom shares to be requoted Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Telekom Malaysia Bhd are to be requoted at the opening of trade on Tuesday, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said in a statement late on Monday.</p>
<p>The shares were last traded on June 6, when they closed at 12.50 ringgit.</p>
<p>The shares had been suspended pending the announcement of the company's entry into the Thai telecommunications market with the acquisition of a 20.12 percent stake in Samart Corp Plc.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
